{"id":213012516441151,"type":"artist","name":"Aqua","artist":null,"year":1994,"weight":18,"info":{"country":"DK","begin":"1994","kind":"Group","similar":["Toy-Box","Vengaboys","A*Teens","Me & My","Bambee","Ace of Base","A Touch of Class","SMiLE.dk","Daze","Real McCoy"],"disambiguation":"Danish Euro‐dance group","img":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/Special:FilePath/Aqua_Gron_Concert_2008.jpg?width=500","bio":"Aqua es un grupo noruego-danés de música pop y música dance. \nSus integrantes son tres daneses: René Dif, Claus Norreen, Søren Rasted y la vocalista del grupo es la noruega Lene Nystrøm. Fueron conocidos por su éxito Barbie Girl (el cual hasta ahora ha seguido teniendo mucho exito).\n\nLa banda fue formada en 1994, y tuvo muchísimo éxito en muchos países en los últimos años de la década de 1990 y en los primeros de la década del 2000. En 1996 grabaron el primer sencillo que se convirtió en un éxito en Dinamarca, Rosses are red.","tags":["pop","dance","eurodance","90s","Europop"]},"works":[{"id":18130386806746,"type":"album","name":"Aquarium","artist":"Aqua","year":1997,"weight":25,"yt":"GoE3YNAaoYk","src":"books,charts,musthear","from":{"books":[{"name":"Scaruffi","title":"A History of Rock Music 1951-2000 (Piero Scaruffi)"}],"podcasts":[],"lists":[{"id":4389278164509,"name":"Music Genre Tree","rank":64,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":13018320481353,"name":"Scaruffi 1990s","rank":413,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":33120364703326,"name":"RYM Top — Dance — Bubblegum Dance","rank":10,"scaruffi":7.0},{"id":49335217989847,"name":"RYM Top — Electronic — Eurodance","rank":26,"scaruffi":7.0}],"n_lists":5}},{"id":3960969789830,"type":"song","name":"Barbie Girl","artist":"Aqua","year":1997,"weight":17,"yt":"ZyhrYis509A","src":"charts,ensayos,singles","from":{"books":[],"podcasts":[{"name":"The Ongoing History of New Music","n":3}],"lists":[{"id":75028305851756,"name":"Los 40 nº1 · 1997","rank":49,"scaruffi":null},{"id":46818025098002,"name":"Billboard Year-End 1997","rank":94,"scaruff